  [#brief-item([Charmmie Hendon], source-name: [Serverless Blog], [I'm Charmmie Hendon, and I'm passionate about diversity and inclusion in tech. Here's a bit of my personal experience, and how you too can affect change.])],
  [#brief-item([Arseni Kravchenko], source-name: [Neon Tech Blog], [Every now and then, people ask me:  “I am new to agentic development, I’m building something, but I feel like I’m missing some tribal knowledge. Help me catch up!” I’m tempted to suggest some serious stuff like multiweek courses (e.g. by HuggingFace or Berkeley), but not everyone is interested in that level of diving. So \[…\]])],
