  [#brief-item([Paul Scanlon], source-name: [Neon Tech Blog], [In this post, I’d like to introduce Neon’s serverless driver which is suitable for use with Vercel Edge Functions. I’ll explain how to use it with Next.js and a free Neon serverless Postgres database Here’s a demo I created. I’ve called it Ping Thing.  What does Ping Thing do? When users click Ping, the app \[…\]])],
